OS X is pretty cool. I've been using it as a desktop for "forever" now. 
Granted I still spend 90% of my time using emacs in a terminal 
window... but it's a stable unix. My OS X sever (the Beige G3 is 
actually older than my 433) hasn't crashed since I installed OS X on 
it... I tend to reboot it often for software updates and similar fun 
things (a lot of the old Mac OS9 ISVs still don't understand that you 
don't need to reboot the OS when you install a user application!), but 
